# veridian-aios.com / dpdp.veridian-aios.com / app.veridian-aios.com -- Cloudflare Pages redirects
# (WO-DPDP-013 v2 §2.4).
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>. src/lib/redirects.test.ts parses
# this file and pins both rules, with and without the trailing slash.
#
# There is deliberately NO rule here that sends dpdp.veridian-aios.com (or the
# legacy app.veridian-aios.com) to veridian-aios.com. A Pages _redirects rule
# matches a PATH, never a host, and this one file is served on ALL THREE
# hostnames -- so such a rule would also redirect the apex to itself (a loop)
# and would swallow /app/, /act/, /copy/, /p/, /unsubscribe/ and /ai/, which
# must stay on dpdp. (the signed-in app, the Monday email's links and the AI
# work link live there; app. keeps serving the same files so links in emails
# already sent keep working). Search engines are
# pointed at the apex by each public page's canonical link, the sitemap and
# robots.txt instead; src/lib/redirects.test.ts pins that no rule here can
# touch a private prefix or move a visitor between hosts.

# The institution edition is singular -- owner decision, 18 Sep 2026.
/dpdp-institutions   /dpdp-institution/   301
/dpdp-institutions/  /dpdp-institution/   301

# /home is the root chooser.
/home                /                    301
/home/               /                    301
